{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43609","headline":"寂上人院联句 · 皮日休","name":"寂上人院联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瘿牀空默坐，清景不知斜。\n暗数菩提子，闲看薜茘花。\n有情惟墨客，无语是禅家。\n背日聊依桂，尝泉欲试茶。\n石形蹲玉虎，池影闪金蛇。\n经笥安岩匼，缾囊挂树桠。\n书传沧海外，龛寄白云涯。\n竹色寒凌箔，灯光静隔纱。\n趁幽飜小品，逐胜讲南华。\n莎彩融黄露，莲衣染素霞。\n水堪伤聚沫，风合落天葩。\n若许传心印，何辞古堞赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}